  "passage": "Join us for a fun weekend camping trip to Green Valley! This event is perfect for sociable teenagers who love the outdoors. We will meet at the school gate at 9 am on Saturday. Please bring your own snacks and a water bottle. For lunch, we will have a picnic, so make sure to bring sandwiches or something similar. The preparation is simple: just pack your bag with warm clothes and a torch. We will set up tents near the lake, and in the evening, we can chat around the campfire. It might be a bit stressful to set up the tent at first, but our leaders will help you. Don't forget to update your phone with the latest map before we go. Travel by aeroplane is not needed; we will go by bus. Remember to listen carefully to the safety instructions. See you there!",
